[32m+[m[32m+# Project Structure[m
[32m+[m[32m+Our project's name is '**final_project**'.[m[41m  [m
[32m+[m[32m+There are **7** apps in the project. They are **adminpanel**, **communication**, **matching**, **payment**, **task**, **user** and **volunteer**.[m[41m  [m
