[32m+[m[32m+## user[m
[32m+[m[32m+This app is about users' registeration and logging-in.[m
[32m+[m[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m+### models.py[m
[32m+[m[32m+**CustomUserManager**: Since we plan not to use usernames, but rather email addresses for logins, we use this to make changes to the default user model.[m
[32m+[m[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m+**CustomUser**: Changed user model with email, password and user type.[m
[32m+[m[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m+**user_directory_path**: The function used to generate the file storage path.[m
[32m+[m[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m+**UserProfile**: Used to store information that is shared between different types of user.[m
[32m+[m[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m+**CertificationType**: Used to store the certification types.[m
[32m+[m[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m+**ConditionType**: Used to store the condition types.[m
[32m+[m[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m+**SupportType**: Used to store the support types.[m
[32m+[m[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m+**ClientProfile**: Used to store information unique to the client.[m
[32m+[m[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m+**VolunteerProfile**: Used to store information unique to the volunteer.[m
[32m+[m[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m+**AdminProfile**: Used to store information unique to the admin.[m
[32m+[m[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m+### forms.py[m
[32m+[m[32m+**ClientRegisterForm**, **VolunteerRegisterForm**: Two register forms.[m
[32m+[m[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m+**ClientProfileForm**, **VolunteerProfileForm**: Two forms used to change profile information.[m
[32m+[m[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m+**ProfilePhotoForm**: The form used to change profile photo.[m
[32m+[m[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m+### utils.py[m
[32m+[m[32m+**normalize_uk_postcode**: Normalize the user input postcode.[m
[32m+[m[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m+**is_valid_aberdeen_postcode**: Check the user input postcode is in Aberdeen or not.[m
[32m+[m[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m+**geocode_address**: Use the user input postcode to get the coordinate.[m
[32m+[m[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m+**send_activation_email**: To send a check email to user.[m
